// 24 October 2026 CT: opt-in Linux task boundary (Bubblewrap). Raw mode was
// qualified without it, because the cluster used for that has no Bubblewrap.
// This profile is not a container/model substitute.
// A Nextflow task has a writable work directory and disposable scratch; the
// driver stages/publishes normally outside the read-only child mount namespace.
// Source paths obey the workflow's existing no-whitespace path contract.
process {
    stageInMode = 'symlink'
    shell = [params.priva_binary, 'task-boundary', 'exec',
             '--task-dir', '.', '--', '/bin/bash', '-e', '-o', 'pipefail']
}
